        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The table below shows the cost of water in 5 cities in Australia. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Water Cost in Five Australian Cities</em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\">Xem livestream giải đề n&agrave;y c&ugrave;ng thầy Phạm Minh Khoa (<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>2 lần 9.0</strong></span>) <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/g8ShaEuz7R0?si=dZVGc1ejKzjQgY8p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tại đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute;!</a></span></span></em></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DZTRdWnGoo5CLexEaLel2aSeg1b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Water Cost in Five Australian Cities y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về chi ph&iacute; tiền nước tại 5 th&agrave;nh phố ở Australia.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HUX9dNOTSo4XJixnvSBlEQlMgph\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span><strong> </strong>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2KUdr10HoS97zxVv0ilC6U1g9d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> &nbsp;Paraphrase đề Water Cost in Five Australian Cities với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: chi ph&iacute; tiền nước - 5 th&agrave;nh phố ở Australia.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UJ7SdIbruoh5NQxTOAHlrIRKgw7\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, đối với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng ta sẽ lần lượt đưa ra c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JdTedMAm3ovJbCxLwbnl3nPOgMg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Sydney</strong> t&iacute;nh mức gi&aacute; cao nhất cho ngưỡng dưới 125 KL. <strong>Perth</strong> v&agrave; <strong>Adelaide</strong> c&oacute; mức gi&aacute; khởi điểm thấp nhất, nhưng họ lại phải trả nhiều nhất cho lượng nước tr&ecirc;n 125 KL.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LldUdzxaoojq8bx50dYlzSuSg7c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Người d&acirc;n ở Perth phải thanh to&aacute;n ho&aacute; đơn nhiều nhất</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CG4Ndan0aoDldyxLV3xlgbRkg8g\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Usage charge per kilometer</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ERvQdGJEEoCx4ExtCKHlcS4ngDh\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wb7sdDiHLonOd4xwWv8lxAQUgTe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phố cho ngưỡng dưới 125 KL </strong><em>(người d&acirc;n ở Sydney phải trả $0.98, theo sau l&agrave; Brisbane v&agrave; Melboroune với khoảng $0.8, gấp đ&ocirc;i số liệu của Adelaide v&agrave; Perth với khoảng $0.42)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DYzpdtkxUoV2YLxrt0olfacCglg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phố cho ngưỡng tr&ecirc;n 125 KL </strong><em>(người d&acirc;n ở Sydney v&agrave; Melbourne cũng cố định như ngưỡng dưới 125KL, Brisbane th&igrave; tăng khoảng $0.03, Adelaide v&agrave; Perth tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i $1.00 v&agrave; $1.50)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CGYmdl2lvotvzUxOISGl2z8SgjS\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Average bill per household</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QRZodF3AEowZrRxrMqflxhmDgLF\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVQndeZQ6ouXP6xR1MOlantWgxd\">(Only 1 step) <strong>So s&aacute;nh c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phố với nhau</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bagod0lVzoI1XwxaEPPlsSo6gFb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><em>Perth v&agrave; Sydney l&agrave; $332 v&agrave; $319</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NYIXdMpYGo5BY7xqfirlNotjgWc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><em>Theo sau l&agrave; Adelaide v&agrave; Brisbane, ở mức $310</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ST2mdWdo7oGWHGxKoW4lqA8CgCd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><em>Melbourne &iacute;t nhất, ở mức $253</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jyc2dH5xFoNAqyxuR5Dl9iKbgQc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt <strong>\"xu hướng tăng\", </strong>m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể sử dụng c&aacute;c cụm/ cấu tr&uacute;c sau<strong> </strong>để đa dạng cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u của m&igrave;nh hơn nh&eacute;:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VHN8dF1lGoD9J9xi0l0lFjJ2g7g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>see an increase <em>(theo một chiều hướng tăng)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PpqSdnSTUoFOsFxM9JLlElfZg0r\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>double/ tripple/ quadruple <em>(tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i/ gấp ba/ gấp bốn)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GjredOsYXo2gn7xO4aglEeZEgJh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HqPWdFIfFoUfsUxc3R1lYT0IgAg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XHbndbBWOobub1xYJp2lEhnhg9f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Brisbane <strong>sees a slight increase</strong> of $0.03 per KL</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-USEBd4xxJokAacxC5W9lXqzHgmh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">There are significant price hikes in Adelaide and Perth, with rates approximately <strong>doubling</strong> to $1.00 in Adelaide and <strong>quadrupling</strong> to $1.50 in Perth.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 177,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VFltd8xdjoEeftxiVx0lFjFDgIe\">The table provides information on average bills and rates paid by households in five Australian cities for water usage, categorized into two thresholds, under and over 125 kiloliters (KL).</div>\n</div>",
